  "characters": [
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46165,
        "name": {
          "full": "Maki Nishikino",
          "native": "西木野真姫",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46165-0SB7Je2kSwnb.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 161 cm\n\nMaki Nishikino is a first-year​ high school student in Otonokizaka High School. She has a beautiful voice and loves jazz music more than anyone else in the group. At first, she didn't want to join µ's because she had decided to inherit their family's hospital and take up medicine in college, but after joining forces with Rin to push Hanayo to join, she decides to follow the same path and join along with her two fellow first years.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "15"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 112211,
          "name": {
            "full": "Pile",
            "native": "パイル"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n112211-0kSgdxg6PVpT.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46163,
        "name": {
          "full": "Nico Yazawa",
          "native": "矢澤にこ",
          "alternative": [
            "Niko Yazawa"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46163-FNug6cIPWxYk.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 154 cm \n\nNico has been observing [Honoka's](https://anilist.co/character/46171/Kousaka-Honoka) new Idol group for a while but eventually joins them. She has past experiences as an amateur school idol. At first, she was secretly the President of the school's unknown Idol Research Club, but after an incident, the club was later joined together with Honoka's Idol Club. She likes bossing people around and acting superior, but she also has an energetic and cheeky personality.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "17"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 106361,
          "name": {
            "full": "Sora Tokui",
            "native": "徳井青空"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106361-EMvWLkEKavEM.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46167,
        "name": {
          "full": "Umi Sonoda",
          "native": "園田海未",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46167-IJSUnNKViPoJ.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height: __159cm\n\nUmi is normally a shy girl, but she has a strong will and some qualities of a leader. Despite this, she is content to stay reserved and always thinks logically. Umi is uncomfortable with wearing short skirts but gets used to it after their first live. Although Umi tends to be hard on others, she is especially hard on herself. She doesn't do anything criminal and despises laziness.\n",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 106359,
          "name": {
            "full": "Suzuko Mimori",
            "native": "三森すずこ"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106359-G8dROMWpwlM6.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46013,
        "name": {
          "full": "Kotori Minami",
          "native": "南ことり",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46013-HjSSOn4C0wMt.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 159 cm\n\nKotori is known for having her head in the clouds. Despite this, she is μ's designer along with [Nico Yazawa](https://anilist.co/character/46163/Yazawa-Nico). Kotori has a very huge aptitude for fashion and is very good at drawing costumes for the group. Kotori is shown to be very kind and supportive to her friends and genuinely cares about them, especially their feelings. However, this can go too far as Kotori usually backs [Honoka](https://anilist.co/character/46171/Kousaka-Honoka) up when she is scolded by [Umi](https://anilist.co/character/46167/Sonoda-Umi).\n\nKotori is also shown as the most indecisive person among all nine members and tends to have her friends make decisions for her. She also has a hard time expressing her feelings, since she always takes other people's feelings into consideration.\n",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 103921,
          "name": {
            "full": "Aya Uchida",
            "native": "内田彩"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n103921-bnSaJsF0jgH1.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46169,
        "name": {
          "full": "Nozomi Toujou",
          "native": "東條希",
          "alternative": [
            "Nozomi Tojo"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46169-yYnDgZprEtAU.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 159 cm \n\nNozomi is the vice-president of Otonokizaka High School. She is the best friend of [Eli](https://anilist.co/character/46173/Ayase-Eli). She is also a Shrine Maiden in a temple because she believes that a shrine is the source of people's faith. Eventually she will join the school idol club with Eli and will be one of the most successful school idols.\n\n(Source: Character Book)",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "17"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 112213,
          "name": {
            "full": "Aina Kusuda",
            "native": "楠田亜衣奈"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n112213-sHwjUu8G5NLO.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46171,
        "name": {
          "full": "Honoka Kousaka",
          "native": "高坂穂乃果",
          "alternative": [
            "Honoka Kosaka"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46171-29iObmCZzIkp.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 157 cm\n\nHonoka is the main character, who is a second-year student at Otonokizaka Academy. Her family works in a japanese sweet shop named Homura. When Otonokizaka Academy is planned to be shut down due to lack of applicants, Honoka becomes determined to save it by starting up a school idol group. Honoka also has a knack for finding loose change on the ground. Since she was young, she has been friends with [Kotori](https://anilist.co/character/46013/Minami-Kotori), and she befriended [Umi](https://anilist.co/character/46167/Sonoda-Umi) after inviting her to play hide and seek.\n\n~!In Season 2, she becomes the new Student Council President by everyone's recommendation.!~\n",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 109409,
          "name": {
            "full": "Emi Nitta",
            "native": "新田恵海"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n109409-TKu56WtuAxMx.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 46011,
        "name": {
          "full": "Rin Hoshizora",
          "native": "星空凛",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46011-UNG2CkZtHKLU.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 155cm\n\nRin appears to be a bit of a tomboy, though with a girly streak. She likes sports and is arguably the most athletic member of μ's, on par with Eli. Like Honoka, Rin is very energetic, hard-working and active. One key difference between her and Honoka, however, is that Rin is known for being very mindful of other people's opinions, as she puts their feelings first before taking action into something.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "15"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
