          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46173-QzCSLzDNFpVj.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 162 cm\n\nEli Ayase is the student council president of the Otonokizaka High School. Along with her best friend, [Nozomi](https://anilist.co/character/46169/Toujou-Nozomi), they do plans so the closure of the school could be prevented. She is partly Russian because her grandmother is a Russian. Alongside Nozomi, they join the school idol group for the prevention of their schools closure.",
